","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:p019","chapter_id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m019-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"樂乘","kind":"person","person_id":"2qv_1rq_zp0","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:p019","chapter_id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji043-100","person_id":"tdu_n2l_m4p","title":"武襄君","kind":"noble_rank","mode":"grant","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p109","quote":"十六年，廉頗圍燕。以樂乘爲武襄君。十七年，假相大將武襄君攻燕，圍其國。十八年，延陵鈞率師從相國信平君助魏攻燕。秦拔我楡次三十七城。十九年，趙與燕易土：以龍兌、汾門、臨樂與燕；燕以葛、武陽、平舒與趙。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji043-100:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p109","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"武襄君","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m109-0013","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"source_event","event_type":"grant","date_expression":"十六年","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p109","quote":"十六年，廉頗圍燕。以樂乘爲武襄君。十七年，假相大將武襄君攻燕，圍其國。十八年，延陵鈞率師從相國信平君助魏攻燕。秦拔我楡次三十七城。十九年，趙與燕易土：以龍兌、汾門、臨樂與燕；燕以葛、武陽、平舒與趙。"}]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"任事、授予與明示免職分開。留秦、出奔、死亡或軍敗不推所有爵位終點；假相大將的職稱組合制度待核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"th-shiji043-101","person_id":"tdu_n2l_m4p","title":"假相大將","kind":"unclassified","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p109","quote":"十六年，廉頗圍燕。以樂乘爲武襄君。十七年，假相大將武襄君攻燕，圍其國。十八年，延陵鈞率師從相國信平君助魏攻燕。秦拔我楡次三十七城。十九年，趙與燕易土：以龍兌、汾門、臨樂與燕；燕以葛、武陽、平舒與趙。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji043-101:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p109","start":21,"end":25,"surface":"假相大將","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m109-0025","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"任事、授予與明示免職分開。留秦、出奔、死亡或軍敗不推所有爵位終點；假相大將的職稱組合制度待核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"th-shiji080-012","person_id":"9t6_8nc_nuo","title":"武襄君","kind":"noble_rank","mode":"grant","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi","source_id":"s-shiji-080-leyi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p017","quote":"樂閒、樂乘怨燕不聽其計，二人卒留趙。趙封樂乘為武襄君。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji080-012:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p017","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"武襄君","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m017-0020","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"source_event","event_type":"grant","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi","source_id":"s-shiji-080-leyi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p017","quote":"樂閒、樂乘怨燕不聽其計，二人卒留趙。趙封樂乘為武襄君。"}]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"授任與文獻用稱分存；卒、出走及降趙不自動終止所有爵位，未見日期保持未定。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji043-240","person_id":"tdu_n2l_m4p","surfaces":["樂乘","武襄君"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p107","quote":"十年，燕攻昌壯，五月拔之。趙將樂乘、慶舍攻秦信梁軍，破之。太子死。而秦攻西周，拔之。徒父祺出。十一年，城元氏，縣上原。武陽君鄭安平死，收其地。十二年，邯鄲廥燒。十四年，平原君趙勝死。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p109","quote":"十六年，廉頗圍燕。以樂乘爲武襄君。十七年，假相大將武襄君攻燕，圍其國。十八年，延陵鈞率師從相國信平君助魏攻燕。秦拔我楡次三十七城。十九年，趙與燕易土：以龍兌、汾門、臨樂與燕；燕以葛、武陽、平舒與趙。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p111","quote":"二十一年，孝成王卒。廉頗將，攻繁陽，取之。使樂乘代之，廉頗攻樂乘，樂乘走，廉頗亡入魏。子偃立，是爲悼襄王。"}],"rationale":"限本篇姓名、封授、繼位及連續事件暫接；偃／悼襄王、遷／幽繆王及樂乘／武襄君按明示上下文保存。篇末長安君、燕王、未名太子及文信侯不補名字或按同爵跨時段合併；徒父祺讀法仍待底本核查。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"d-shiji080-025","person_id":"9t6_8nc_nuo","scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-080-leyi"],"status":"contextual_provisional","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["樂乘"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p015","quote":"樂閒居燕三十餘年，燕王喜用其相栗腹之計，欲攻趙，而問昌國君樂閒。樂閒曰：「趙，四戰之國也，其民習兵，伐之不可。」燕王不聽，遂伐趙。趙使廉頗擊之，大破栗腹之軍於鄗，禽栗腹、樂乘。樂乘者，樂閒之宗也。於是樂閒奔趙，趙遂圍燕。燕重割地以與趙和，趙乃解而去。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p017","quote":"樂閒、樂乘怨燕不聽其計，二人卒留趙。趙封樂乘為武襄君。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p018","quote":"其明年，樂乘、廉頗為趙圍燕，燕重禮以和，乃解。後五歲，趙孝成王卒。襄王使樂乘代廉頗。廉頗攻樂乘，樂乘走，廉頗亡入魏。其後十六年而秦滅趙。"}],"rationale":"樂閒明示為樂毅子，樂叔明示為孫，不補闕代父親；樂乘為樂閒宗不補兄弟。燕王喜來書及趙襄王君序各限本段，曹相國未見名字不回填。河上丈人至蓋公師承不作父子。依本篇明示姓名、君序與來書答書範圍暫接；燕惠王來書寡人指惠王、將軍指樂毅，樂毅答書先王指昭王、足下君王指惠王。伍子胥引古首吳王指闔閭，後吳王在夫差賜鴟夷後指夫差。父兄與群臣不補具體親屬，王齊為反間假說不作授王爵。"},{"id":"d-shiji081-014","person_id":"2qv_1rq_zp0","scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-081-lianlin"],"status":"contextual_provisional","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["樂乘"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:p011","quote":"秦伐韓，軍於閼與。王召廉頗而問曰：「可救不？」對曰：「道遠險狹，難救。」又召樂乘而問焉，樂乘對如廉頗言。又召問趙奢，奢對曰：「其道遠險狹，譬之猶兩鼠鬥於穴中，將勇者勝。」王乃令趙奢將，救之。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:p019","quote":"趙孝成王卒，子悼襄王立，使樂乘代廉頗。廉頗怒，攻樂乘，樂乘走。廉頗遂奔魏之大梁。其明年，趙乃以李牧爲將而攻燕，拔武遂、方城。"}],"rationale":"依本篇明示姓名、國別君序與代將敘事暫接；李牧牧在明示北邊主題內同指，趙王遷王稱限定末次代將。北邊早年趙王、他人及單于未名分存，不強接悼襄；太史公讓頗承接廉藺敘事，其他引語指代待逐處覆核。"}],"equivalence_decisions":[{"id":"eq-shiji080-cheng","person_ids":["tdu_n2l_m4p","9t6_8nc_nuo"],"canonical_person_id":"tdu_n2l_m4p","scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao","c-shiji-080-leyi"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p109","quote":"十六年，廉頗圍燕。以樂乘爲武襄君。十七年，假相大將武襄君攻燕，圍其國。十八年，延陵鈞率師從相國信平君助魏攻燕。秦拔我楡次三十七城。十九年，趙與燕易土：以龍兌、汾門、臨樂與燕；燕以葛、武陽、平舒與趙。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao:m109-0010","c-shiji-043-zhao:m109-0013","c-shiji-043-zhao:m109-0025"]},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p111","quote":"二十一年，孝成王卒。廉頗將，攻繁陽，取之。使樂乘代之，廉頗攻樂乘，樂乘走，廉頗亡入魏。子偃立，是爲悼襄王。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao:m111-0022","c-shiji-043-zhao:m111-0030","c-shiji-043-zhao:m111-0033"]},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi","source_id":"s-shiji-080-leyi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p018","quote":"其明年，樂乘、廉頗為趙圍燕，燕重禮以和，乃解。後五歲，趙孝成王卒。襄王使樂乘代廉頗。廉頗攻樂乘，樂乘走，廉頗亡入魏。其後十六年而秦滅趙。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-080-leyi:m018-0004","c-shiji-080-leyi:m018-0036","c-shiji-080-leyi:m018-0045","c-shiji-080-leyi:m018-0048"]}],"rationale":"趙世家樂乘封武襄君、攻燕，孝成王卒後代廉頗、被廉頗攻而走，本篇同一封爵、攻燕及代將敗走事件相配；姓名、爵稱與連續事件支持同指。燕伐趙時被禽與他篇攻代的角色差異各留。 各篇原字、原文與已發ID保留，同書不視為獨立見證；同指不確證所有紀年、任職、親屬或敘事，不按全域同名批量改號。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"eq-shiji081-cheng","person_ids":["tdu_n2l_m4p","9t6_8nc_nuo","2qv_1rq_zp0"],"canonical_person_id":"tdu_n2l_m4p","scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao","c-shiji-080-leyi","c-shiji-081-lianlin"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p111","quote":"二十一年，孝成王卒。廉頗將，攻繁陽，取之。使樂乘代之，廉頗攻樂乘，樂乘走，廉頗亡入魏。子偃立，是爲悼襄王。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao:m111-0022","c-shiji-043-zhao:m111-0030","c-shiji-043-zhao:m111-0033"]},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi","source_id":"s-shiji-080-leyi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p018","quote":"其明年，樂乘、廉頗為趙圍燕，燕重禮以和，乃解。後五歲，趙孝成王卒。襄王使樂乘代廉頗。廉頗攻樂乘，樂乘走，廉頗亡入魏。其後十六年而秦滅趙。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-080-leyi:m018-0004","c-shiji-080-leyi:m018-0036","c-shiji-080-leyi:m018-0045","c-shiji-080-leyi:m018-0048"]},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin","source_id":"s-shiji-081-lianlin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:p019","quote":"趙孝成王卒，子悼襄王立，使樂乘代廉頗。廉頗怒，攻樂乘，樂乘走。廉頗遂奔魏之大梁。其明年，趙乃以李牧爲將而攻燕，拔武遂、方城。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-081-lianlin:m019-0013","c-shiji-081-lianlin:m019-0024","c-shiji-081-lianlin:m019-0027"]}],"rationale":"三篇樂乘在孝成卒後代廉頗、被廉頗攻而走，同一前任、君序及代將事件支持同指，不由同指判定燕戰被禽與攻代差異。 各篇原字、原文與已發ID保留，同書不視為獨立見證；同指不確證所有紀年、任職、親屬或敘事，不按全域同名批量改號。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p107","text":"十年，燕攻昌壯，五月拔之。趙將樂乘、慶舍攻秦信梁軍，破之。太子死。而秦攻西周，拔之。徒父祺出。十一年，城元氏，縣上原。武陽君鄭安平死，收其地。十二年，邯鄲廥燒。十四年，平原君趙勝死。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m107-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"樂乘","kind":"person","person_id":"tdu_n2l_m4p","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m107-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"慶舍","kind":"person","person_id":"wmx_rqf_b09","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m107-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"5aj_khx_izm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m107-0042","start":42,"end":45,"surface":"徒父祺","kind":"person","person_id":"5on_fmd_qzc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m107-0059","start":59,"end":65,"surface":"武陽君鄭安平","kind":"person","person_id":"ug2_2v6_hbv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m107-0084","start":84,"end":89,"surface":"平原君趙勝","kind":"person","person_id":"03v_bhv_img","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","book_id":"b-shiji-043","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p109","text":"十六年，廉頗圍燕。以樂乘爲武襄君。十七年，假相大將武襄君攻燕，圍其國。十八年，延陵鈞率師從相國信平君助魏攻燕。秦拔我楡次三十七城。十九年，趙與燕易土：以龍兌、汾門、臨樂與燕；燕以葛、武陽、平舒與趙。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m109-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"廉頗","kind":"person","person_id":"uk8_q7t_7u9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m109-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"樂乘","kind":"person","person_id":"tdu_n2l_m4p","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m109-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"武襄君","kind":"person","person_id":"tdu_n2l_m4p","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m109-0021","start":21,"end":25,"surface":"假相大將","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職稱與匿名詞保留；未名者不補熟知姓名。述贊省稱限本篇對讀，不另增加事件或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m109-0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"武襄君","kind":"person","person_id":"tdu_n2l_m4p","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m109-0039","start":39,"end":42,"surface":"延陵鈞","kind":"person","person_id":"f9c_9te_ebx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m109-0045","start":45,"end":50,"surface":"相國信平君","kind":"person","person_id":"uk8_q7t_7u9","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","book_id":"b-shiji-043","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p111","text":"二十一年，孝成王卒。廉頗將，攻繁陽，取之。使樂乘代之，廉頗攻樂乘，樂乘走，廉頗亡入魏。子偃立，是爲悼襄王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m111-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"孝成王","kind":"person","person_id":"q6w_qm5_w2b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m111-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"廉頗","kind":"person","person_id":"uk8_q7t_7u9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m111-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"樂乘","kind":"person","person_id":"tdu_n2l_m4p","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m111-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"廉頗","kind":"person","person_id":"uk8_q7t_7u9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m111-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"樂乘","kind":"person","person_id":"tdu_n2l_m4p","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m111-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"樂乘","kind":"person","person_id":"tdu_n2l_m4p","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m111-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"廉頗","kind":"person","person_id":"uk8_q7t_7u9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m111-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"子偃","kind":"person","person_id":"q6w_qm5_w2b_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m111-0049","start":49,"end":52,"surface":"悼襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"q6w_qm5_w2b_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","book_id":"b-shiji-043","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p015","text":"樂閒居燕三十餘年，燕王喜用其相栗腹之計，欲攻趙，而問昌國君樂閒。樂閒曰：「趙，四戰之國也，其民習兵，伐之不可。」燕王不聽，遂伐趙。趙使廉頗擊之，大破栗腹之軍於鄗，禽栗腹、樂乘。樂乘者，樂閒之宗也。於是樂閒奔趙，趙遂圍燕。燕重割地以與趙和，趙乃解而去。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m015-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"樂閒","kind":"person","person_id":"idh_bo6_4kq_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m015-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"燕王喜","kind":"person","person_id":"usu_jat_0ky","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m015-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"栗腹","kind":"person","person_id":"o3v_ms0_idw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m015-0026","start":26,"end":31,"surface":"昌國君樂閒","kind":"person","person_id":"idh_bo6_4kq_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m015-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"樂閒","kind":"person","person_id":"idh_bo6_4kq_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m015-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"燕王","kind":"person","person_id":"usu_jat_0ky","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m015-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"廉頗","kind":"person","person_id":"gt7_y57_atj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m015-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"栗腹","kind":"person","person_id":"o3v_ms0_idw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m015-0082","start":82,"end":84,"surface":"栗腹","kind":"person","person_id":"o3v_ms0_idw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m015-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"樂乘","kind":"person","person_id":"9t6_8nc_nuo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m015-0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"樂乘","kind":"person","person_id":"9t6_8nc_nuo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m015-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"樂閒","kind":"person","person_id":"idh_bo6_4kq_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m015-0100","start":100,"end":102,"surface":"樂閒","kind":"person","person_id":"idh_bo6_4kq_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi","book_id":"b-shiji-080","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-080-leyi"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p017","text":"樂閒、樂乘怨燕不聽其計，二人卒留趙。趙封樂乘為武襄君。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m017-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"樂閒","kind":"person","person_id":"idh_bo6_4kq_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m017-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"樂乘","kind":"person","person_id":"9t6_8nc_nuo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m017-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"二人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體或未定後裔保留，不補未見姓名或直接父親。"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m017-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"樂乘","kind":"person","person_id":"9t6_8nc_nuo","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi","book_id":"b-shiji-080","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-080-leyi"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p018","text":"其明年，樂乘、廉頗為趙圍燕，燕重禮以和，乃解。後五歲，趙孝成王卒。襄王使樂乘代廉頗。廉頗攻樂乘，樂乘走，廉頗亡入魏。其後十六年而秦滅趙。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m018-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"樂乘","kind":"person","person_id":"9t6_8nc_nuo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m018-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"廉頗","kind":"person","person_id":"gt7_y57_atj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m018-0027","start":27,"end":31,"surface":"趙孝成王","kind":"person","person_id":"k2w_1d2_5u5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m018-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"vju_g6h_b0j","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m018-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"樂乘","kind":"person","person_id":"9t6_8nc_nuo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m018-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"廉頗","kind":"person","person_id":"gt7_y57_atj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m018-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"廉頗","kind":"person","person_id":"gt7_y57_atj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m018-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"樂乘","kind":"person","person_id":"9t6_8nc_nuo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m018-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"樂乘","kind":"person","person_id":"9t6_8nc_nuo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m018-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"廉頗","kind":"person","person_id":"gt7_y57_atj","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi","book_id":"b-shiji-080","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-080-leyi"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:p011","text":"秦伐韓，軍於閼與。王召廉頗而問曰：「可救不？」對曰：「道遠險狹，難救。」又召樂乘而問焉，樂乘對如廉頗言。又召問趙奢，奢對曰：「其道遠險狹，譬之猶兩鼠鬥於穴中，將勇者勝。」王乃令趙奢將，救之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m011-0009","start":9,"end":10,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"d9b_5t4_9eb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m011-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"廉頗","kind":"person","person_id":"we8_3f9_z9b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m011-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"樂乘","kind":"person","person_id":"2qv_1rq_zp0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m011-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"樂乘","kind":"person","person_id":"2qv_1rq_zp0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m011-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"廉頗","kind":"person","person_id":"we8_3f9_z9b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m011-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"趙奢","kind":"person","person_id":"6zt_fca_se8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m011-0058","start":58,"end":59,"surface":"奢","kind":"person","person_id":"6zt_fca_se8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m011-0085","start":85,"end":86,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"d9b_5t4_9eb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m011-0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"趙奢","kind":"person","person_id":"6zt_fca_se8","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin","book_id":"b-shiji-081","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-081-lianlin"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:p019","text":"趙孝成王卒，子悼襄王立，使樂乘代廉頗。廉頗怒，攻樂乘，樂乘走。廉頗遂奔魏之大梁。其明年，趙乃以李牧爲將而攻燕，拔武遂、方城。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m019-0000","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"趙孝成王","kind":"person","person_id":"d9b_5t4_9eb_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m019-0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"悼襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"d9b_5t4_9eb_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m019-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"樂乘","kind":"person","person_id":"2qv_1rq_zp0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m019-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"廉頗","kind":"person","person_id":"we8_3f9_z9b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m019-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"廉頗","kind":"person","person_id":"we8_3f9_z9b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m019-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"樂乘","kind":"person","person_id":"2qv_1rq_zp0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":